# Design system — global rule (R2)

Every visual change in `apps/`, `packages/ui/`, or `packages/theme/` must follow:

- [`docs/design-system/RULES.md`](../../docs/design-system/RULES.md) — enforceable must/must-not
- [`docs/design-system/SPEC.md`](../../docs/design-system/SPEC.md) — exact tokens and classes
- [`docs/design-system/DESIGN.md`](../../docs/design-system/DESIGN.md) — intent and surface roles

## Hard constraints

- **No ad-hoc glass** on panels/cards: no raw `backdrop-blur-*` or `bg-white/` opacity fills ≥20 on structural surfaces.
- Use `.os-shell*` (chrome) or `GlassCard` / `.glass-card` (cards), backed by `--arch-glass-*` tokens.
- **Never** run `generate-tokens.mjs` for CSS value edits — edit `packages/theme/src/css/variables.css` directly.
- Token/class changes → update SPEC.md in the same commit; structural changes → ADR in `packages/theme/DECISIONS.md`.

## Verification

```bash
pnpm design:ratchet
pnpm theme:shape
pnpm --filter @repo/theme lint:tokens
```
